ion></figure><p>經過新竹一區域「頭髮必衝天」…氣象粉專分析揭秘：快檢查</p><p>吃飯遭男敲桌逼讓座！對方嗆「我小孩要坐」 她回1句慘遭飆罵</p><p>【本文獲「聯合新聞網」授權轉載。】</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-24T04:24:26.618326+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1494,"images":20,"source":"HK01 熱話","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-24T04:00:48+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T06:28:03.964524+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-24T04:18:23.854249+00:00","content_hash":"11dd6969802fbf61ecf891cdb0faf715167f2c0788b92f5fe5eabe716a3b6a2a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}